I don't think we should rely on doc comments for the intended use of these methods. The only use case so far is for this to be used as a `const secp256k1_keypair*`, and I think moving the reintepret cast to this method is easier to reason about (and has no performance cost). I suggest keeping this scoped to silent payments with the following, which should be easier for reviewers to understand the purpose of this commit:

```diff
